WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.534 --> 00:00:12.740
Emmy started taking violin lessons.

2
00:00:12.741 --> 00:00:20.548
She practiced every day.

3
00:00:20.549 --> 00:00:23.990
Harry groaned.

4
00:00:23.991 --> 00:00:27.898
"You play the same song again and again!"

5
00:00:27.899 --> 00:00:32.732
"I have to learn this song," Emmy said.

6
00:00:32.733 --> 00:00:38.116
"I have a recital in two weeks!"

7
00:00:38.117 --> 00:00:40.345
Emmy kept practicing.

8
00:00:40.346 --> 00:00:47.672
Sometimes the song sounded loud.

9
00:00:47.673 --> 00:00:52.929
Sometimes it sounded squeaky.

10
00:00:52.930 --> 00:00:59.473
Sometimes it just sounded awful!

11
00:00:59.474 --> 00:01:04.399
When Emmy practiced, Oliver plugged his ears.

12
00:01:04.400 --> 00:01:09.548
Harry put a pillow over his head.

13
00:01:09.549 --> 00:01:16.418
Aunt Judy went for a walk.

14
00:01:16.419 --> 00:01:23.756
Emmy practiced and practiced.

15
00:01:23.757 --> 00:01:28.592
The song started to sound better.

16
00:01:28.593 --> 00:01:32.388
"I think I'm learning it!" she said.

17
00:01:32.389 --> 00:01:36.296
The recital finally came.

18
00:01:36.297 --> 00:01:41.035
Kids played many different instruments.

19
00:01:41.036 --> 00:01:47.878
A boy played the piano.

20
00:01:47.879 --> 00:01:53.962
A girl played drums.

21
00:01:53.963 --> 00:01:57.372
"Wow!" Harry said.

22
00:01:57.373 --> 00:02:03.424
"Those drums sound awesome!"

23
00:02:03.425 --> 00:02:07.481
"The kids practiced a lot," said Dad.

24
00:02:07.482 --> 00:02:10.611
"That's why the music sounds good."

25
00:02:10.612 --> 00:02:12.928
Harry nodded.

26
00:02:12.929 --> 00:02:17.418
"I guess musicians have to practice!"

27
00:02:17.419 --> 00:02:20.958
At last it was Emmy's turn.

28
00:02:20.959 --> 00:02:26.881
She carried her violin onto the stage.

29
00:02:26.882 --> 00:02:38.506
She was very nervous.

30
00:02:38.507 --> 00:02:46.923
Emmy played her song perfectly!

31
00:02:46.924 --> 00:02:53.110
Everyone clapped.

32
00:02:53.111 --> 00:02:57.066
"We're so proud of you!" Mom said.

33
00:02:57.067 --> 00:02:59.466
Emmy smiled.

34
00:02:59.467 --> 00:03:05.917
"I'm glad I practiced a lot," she said.

35
00:03:05.918 --> 00:03:10.698
"Can I learn to play the drums, Dad?" Harry asked.

36
00:03:10.699 --> 00:03:15.929
"I'll practice every day!"

37
00:03:15.930 --> 00:03:21.385
Oliver groaned. "Oh no!

38
00:03:21.386 --> 00:03:33.180
Here we go again!"
